<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch unemployment falls in three months to Oct.</title>
<headline>Dutch unemployment falls in three months to Oct.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Neerlands 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch non-seasonally adjusted unemployment fell to an average of 438,000 in the three months to October from 441,000 in the three months to September, the Central Bureau for Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
</text>
